            </note>
            <note corresp="#d664-f2" n="72" xml:id="d664-f2-content">
                <p>Signed at Moscow, June 16, 1989; text in translation transmitted to the
                    Department by the Ambassador in China in his despatch No. 497, April 2, 1940,
                    not printed (661.93331/34).</p>
            </note>
